# Issue #187: prism-media (a dependency of @discordjs/voice) lists
# @discordjs/opus as an optional peer -- npm auto-installs optional peers
# by default, which pulls in @discordjs/opus's node-pre-gyp build
# toolchain and its unpatched ("no fix available") critical tar/rimraf
# vulnerabilities. We use opusscript (a pure-JS Opus codec, no native
# build) instead, so this native optional peer is never needed. omit=optional
# stops npm from auto-satisfying it.
omit=optional
